<title>UK: NationsBank sets $400 million seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>NationsBank sets $400 million seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONSBANK CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $400 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    02.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  ISS PRICE  99.684    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  REOFFER    99.684</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
